## 15. Research Limitations

Blockchain data is powerful, but it has limitations.

An on-chain record may demonstrate that:

- An address received funds
- An address sent funds
- A transaction occurred
- A transaction was included in a block
- A particular UTXO was created or spent

It may not, by itself, establish:

- The legal identity of the person controlling an address
- The intent behind a transaction
- The business purpose of a transfer
- Whether multiple addresses belong to the same individual
- Whether an address belongs to a particular organization

Additional evidence may be required for attribution.

